<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-20T13:19:56.389Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:19:56 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Félix Gallardo, founder of the Guadalajara cartel, died in prison, prompting police deployments around his hospital. The United States announced a $10 million reward for information on Mexican cartel money-laundering networks and added a new Latin American group to its foreign terrorist organization list, now totaling 22. Four gunmen, including two minors, were arrested in Mazatlán with weapons, motorcycles and a vehicle seized. A terrorist cartel bombed a civilian target in Sinaloa, killing an innocent man. Domestic violence files in Puerto Vallarta rose 76 percent, and there were 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/11/18/world/trump-xi-putin-apec/claudia-sheinbaum-mexico-flight-china-apec&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3375244/mexican-leader-sheinbaums-21-hour-economy-class-journey-draws-praise-china&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPUFJhckcyRXdydEFxZWg3NS1XOW5SaWNPWHNxbHprVVFwUm1yLUR6UzZGTVI3ZEVUc2I1UjBGMDlwSGZJUGRic1hGVzNBZlZuUnd0ZXZraGNzbUxvcENUTmZLaG5CVlVpVW1DQnBpVXhuTURGdU1tejM5N3FpVWNBRnBxbjN4TGU1eDg5cWxJYmxISk9UYTRMem1RN1RoSXM?oc=5&quot;&gt;West Orlando News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;OKC Thunder Wire&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNMzlzSXktb2ZwU0hSUzNaeGlrVWVpaW9od2l5NkFzUzR6Nm9QTHhpOEh2UGE5S1JWNWlFUWc2TUtuTzd2emk4d0ZibnZmeVowNVJGNk5GdWtiWkYzeTNfMlNWdlpyTk5TZDJOanNRVElFY3k0M1o3Q1hRV3A0OTA3aHY2LTNoU1ppQjQ2OWlLX3dJWGg4UmVSZUZsWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dickson County Source&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Parriva&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articl